veles-agent (0.2.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Errata release for 0.2.2: the fleet's deployment-consistency check
    compares the point release and the commit (a module a platform does
    not load, or one standing by for a lease, no longer makes a fleet
    inconsistent; a published build names the development commit it was
    exported from, so it matches a build of that commit), the Android
    packages report the commit they were built from, an IRC reply no
    longer carries the bot's own nick in front of every line, and a
    backup carries the command center's audit trail.

 -- veles-agent maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

veles-agent (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Errata release for 0.2.0 and 0.2.1: fixes found by an audit of the
    code and by driving the real desktop (tool-result replay, compaction,
    the Dev editor and extension creation, the Instances tab, placement
    of delegated work, the browser tab bridge, restart recovery, the
    translator), and node management in the fleet command center
    (restart, per-node config, alerts, bulk actions, an audit trail and
    a deployment-consistency view). 0.2.1 was a hotfix for the
    translation result pane and was not packaged here.

